1
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,060
Where did those videos come from?

2
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:21,840
It's none of your business

3
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:23,040
where they came from.

4
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:25,560
Did you do

5
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:26,690
what I told you to do?

6
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:28,280
Tell me.

7
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:31,120
Where did they come from?

8
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:33,130
I was forced to do it too.

9
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:36,640
If you don't withdraw the appeal,

10
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:39,680
I'm doomed too.

11
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:48,080
How did you find me?

12
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:50,370
One of the photos I received

13
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:52,880
showed your face.

14
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:05,600
Tell me right now

15
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:07,200
where those videos and photos came from.

16
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:09,060
Did Zhao Nanfeng give them to you?

17
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:13,000
Who else could it be?

18
00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:15,720
She didn't just secretly film your sister,

19
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:17,320
she filmed me too.

20
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:19,160
She wants to use these secrets

21
00:01:19,160 --> 00:01:21,220
to leech off me for the rest of my life.

22
00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:30,760
Do you really not know about
your sister's past before she got married?

23
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:31,960
Make yourself clear.

24
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:38,300
We used to hang out with Zhao Nanfeng.

25
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:40,820
Your sister

26
00:01:42,039 --> 00:01:44,039
is more complicated than you think.

27
00:01:57,960 --> 00:01:58,640
It's so late

28
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:00,200
and you two are still working.

29
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,600
You're working too hard.

30
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:03,520
You're here again.

31
00:02:03,520 --> 00:02:05,120
Don't you have to work today?

32
00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:06,840
Your bag is so pretty.

33
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,570
It must be a designer brand.

34
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:11,039
I haven't seen you carry
the same bag twice this month.

35
00:02:11,039 --> 00:02:11,760
You want it?

36
00:02:12,720 --> 00:02:13,480
Then

37
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:14,980
it's yours.

38
00:02:15,320 --> 00:02:16,450
Try it on, let me see.

39
00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:18,079
Really?

40
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,400
Does it look good?

41
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:23,600
It looks great.

42
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:25,840
This leather is really nice.

43
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:26,880
Yawen,

44
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:29,920
are you guys going to do this forever?

45
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:31,250
There's no future in it.

46
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:32,160
We

47
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:34,090
didn't even finish middle school.

48
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:35,240
What else

49
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:36,240
can we do?

50
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:39,240
I used to hope to work
in an office building.

51
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:40,400
But I couldn't study.

52
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:42,000
I just don't have that kind of luck.

53
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,600
You two are so young,

54
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:44,400
with pretty faces

55
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:45,360
and great figures.

56
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:47,290
That's your capital to make money.

57
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:49,880
Really?

58
00:02:50,040 --> 00:02:51,120
Can we really do it?

59
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:52,560
Of course.

60
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:57,000
This bag is too expensive.

61
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,060
We can't accept it.

62
00:02:59,040 --> 00:03:00,040
You don't like it?

63
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:00,600
No,

64
00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:01,480
I love it.

65
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:02,800
But...

66
00:03:05,160 --> 00:03:07,240
We've actually been discussing this
for a long time.

67
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,840
We don't want to dance here

68
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:09,880
like idiots.

69
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,000
We

70
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:13,730
want to work for you.

71
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:15,000
Work for me?

72
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:19,000
Do you even know what I do?

73
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:22,360
We saw you at the opening of that company

74
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,240
the other day.

75
00:03:23,720 --> 00:03:26,400
You were leading a group
of girls doing reception.

76
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:26,880
Ma'am,

77
00:03:27,079 --> 00:03:28,520
we're just as good as them.

78
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,160
If we work for you,

79
00:03:29,160 --> 00:03:30,960
we'll definitely do a great job.

80
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,320
Well,

81
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:34,970
I'll think about it.

82
00:03:36,920 --> 00:03:37,850
The bag is yours.

83
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:38,800
Yawen,

84
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:40,500
a welcome gift.

85
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:42,520
Thank you.

86
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:43,640
Thank you.

87
00:03:43,760 --> 00:03:44,090
Okay,

88
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:45,530
I'll get going then.

89
00:03:48,200 --> 00:03:49,760
Zhao Nanfeng got us a gig

90
00:03:50,160 --> 00:03:51,040
as models.

91
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:52,560
We just had to stand there

92
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:53,490
and we'd get 500.

93
00:03:55,440 --> 00:03:56,000
You,

94
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,260
sit up a little higher.

95
00:03:59,280 --> 00:03:59,920
Good.

96
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:02,610
Looks great.

97
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:03,880
Pull your skirt

98
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:04,520
up a bit.

99
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:05,920
I'll be exposed.

100
00:04:06,160 --> 00:04:06,600
It's fine.

101
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:07,320
Trust me,

102
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:08,240
it looks good.

103
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:12,360
Move your hand

104
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,420
over here a bit.

105
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:14,320
It looks great.

106
00:04:14,320 --> 00:04:14,800
Trust me.

107
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:15,840
Why are you touching me?

108
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:16,360
Get up

109
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:17,160
there.

110
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:18,680
I paid for this, okay?

111
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:19,730
Get up there.

112
00:04:21,959 --> 00:04:22,620
Who are you?

113
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:24,000
My camera!

114
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:25,180
I...

115
00:04:27,320 --> 00:04:28,240
I've been shooting

116
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:29,200
all day!

117
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:33,760
Where did this bitch come from?

118
00:04:33,760 --> 00:04:34,800
I've been shooting all day,

119
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:35,730
I'm telling you!

120
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:37,380
Who are you?

121
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:41,520
Zhao Nanfeng was loyal and generous.

122
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:43,120
Yawen and I both admired her.

123
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:45,770
We listened to everything
she said back then.

124
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:50,000
Are you saying

125
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:53,659
my sister was always taken care of
by Zhao Nanfeng all those years?

126
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:56,860
Are you stupid?

127
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:59,800
She was just putting on an act for us.

128
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:01,640
If she didn't do that,

129
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:04,170
how could she manipulate us later?

130
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:10,500
Did you withdraw the appeal
like I told you to

131
00:05:10,520 --> 00:05:11,600
or not?

132
00:05:18,760 --> 00:05:20,760
I know you have hatred in your heart,

133
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,440
but I'm begging you,

134
00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:23,700
please have pity on me.

135
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,460
I didn't kill your sister.

136
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:29,400
I'm a victim too.

137
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:35,320
Zhao Nanfeng wanted to use these things

138
00:05:35,320 --> 00:05:36,920
to threaten both of us.

139
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:40,320
I know you still

140
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:42,159
can't let go of your sister's death,

141
00:05:42,159 --> 00:05:43,960
but I'm just an ordinary person.

142
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:45,880
I have a husband

143
00:05:45,880 --> 00:05:46,880
and a child.

144
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:49,880
I just want to live
a normal life in peace.

145
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:52,560
Don't hate me,

146
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:53,760
okay?

147
00:05:54,440 --> 00:05:55,400
Don't hate me.

148
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:57,080
I had no other choice.

149
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,200
Who is it?

150
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:05,640
Who is it?

151
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:07,820
What are you doing?

152
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:10,000
Come back!

153
00:06:12,840 --> 00:06:13,500
Zhou Yajun,

154
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:15,320
you colluded with the prosecutor

155
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:16,400
to set me up!

156
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:17,760
You called the police,

157
00:06:17,760 --> 00:06:19,120
didn't you?

158
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:20,040
You're trying to get me killed!

159
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:20,440
Ma'am,

160
00:06:20,760 --> 00:06:21,560
please calm

161
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,720
down.

162
00:06:22,880 --> 00:06:23,480
Liu Qian,

163
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:26,440
we are the prosecutors
in charge of Zhou Yawen's murder case.

164
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:27,500
Whatever you know,

165
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:29,000
please tell us everything

166
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,000
and cooperate with our investigation.

167
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:32,040
Even if Zhou Yajun withdraws the appeal,

168
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:32,700
do you think

169
00:06:32,960 --> 00:06:35,120
Zhao Nanfeng will stop threatening you?

170
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,480
We understand your situation.

171
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:38,440
Running away won't solve the problem.

172
00:06:38,440 --> 00:06:40,440
You and Zhou Yawen are both victims.

173
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:43,460
Don't you want Zhao Nanfeng
brought to justice?

174
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:45,200
Zhou Yajun

175
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:47,000
comes to the prosecutor's office
month after month,

176
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:49,000
just to seek justice for his sister.

177
00:06:49,520 --> 00:06:52,200
Withdrawing the appeal
won't solve anything now.

178
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:53,320
Whatever you know,

179
00:06:53,760 --> 00:06:55,560
we hope you can tell us the truth.

180
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:01,120
Ask whatever you want

181
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:02,180
to know.

182
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,840
Keep telling us about your past.

183
00:07:05,400 --> 00:07:07,120
How did Zhou Yawen give in?

184
00:07:09,400 --> 00:07:12,060
She didn't want to be
with Zhao Nanfeng at first,

185
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:14,140
but it was so much money...

186
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:16,520
She compromised

187
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:18,260
because of you.

188
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:20,800
Because of me?

189
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:23,940
If it weren't for your sister,

190
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:26,600
where do you think you'd get the money

191
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,680
to stay in school?

192
00:07:33,760 --> 00:07:35,159
You did well last time.

193
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:37,000
Here's your reward.

194
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:44,280
How much can you really make
just working as a model?

195
00:07:44,280 --> 00:07:46,920
You can still ask for a good price
while you're young.

196
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:47,800
In a few years,

197
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:49,360
you won't even have the assets

198
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,820
to make this kind of money.

199
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:05,720
30,000...

200
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:06,120
30,000.

201
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:08,200
Your brother is still in school, right?

202
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:09,880
I've heard he wants to drop out

203
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:11,280
because he can't afford tutoring.

204
00:08:11,280 --> 00:08:13,000
And your mom is seriously ill.

205
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:15,320
Your family is drowning in debt.

206
00:08:15,840 --> 00:08:16,400
You're

207
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:17,720
the oldest child.

208
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:20,200
If you don't take on this responsibility,

209
00:08:20,200 --> 00:08:20,960
who will?

210
00:08:28,880 --> 00:08:29,740
Think about it.

211
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:31,050
I'm leaving.

212
00:08:39,039 --> 00:08:39,970
I won't push you.

213
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:41,919
I'll just talk about myself.

214
00:08:41,919 --> 00:08:43,600
At first, I didn't want to either.

215
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:45,060
I thought it was shameful.

216
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:47,200
But pride is an illusion.

217
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:50,960
Only cold hard cash is real.

218
00:08:51,680 --> 00:08:52,600
With money,

219
00:08:53,160 --> 00:08:54,360
pride

220
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:55,020
and respect

221
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:56,160
will follow.

222
00:08:56,920 --> 00:08:58,320
Think it over carefully.

223
00:09:02,920 --> 00:09:04,320
If you really don't want to do it,

224
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:06,520
you'll have to return the money, right?

225
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:07,800
30,000.

226
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:10,120
Do you even have a dime on you?

227
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:12,050
Don't you know your own situation?

228
00:09:15,280 --> 00:09:15,810
Besides,

229
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:17,480
if you offend her,

230
00:09:17,800 --> 00:09:18,480
you won't get any work

231
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,480
in the future.

232
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:20,320
How will you make money?

233
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,980
How will you pay off your debt?

234
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:28,690
Well,

235
00:09:29,800 --> 00:09:31,000
let me think about it.

236
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:36,500
I don't believe it.

237
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:41,080
You already took the money,

238
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:42,080
and now you say you don't believe it?

239
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:43,680
My sister wouldn't compromise for money.

240
00:09:43,680 --> 00:09:44,920
You must have forced her.

241
00:09:44,920 --> 00:09:45,580
Zhou Yajun,

242
00:09:45,600 --> 00:09:46,200
Calm down.

243
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:48,050
Sit down and we'll talk.

244
00:09:55,920 --> 00:09:56,450
Liu Qian,

245
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,720
you need to explain this clearly.

246
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:00,280
Was Zhou Yawen willing,

247
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:01,640
or was she forced?

248
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:05,840
After that,

249
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,720
Zhou Yawen went to Zhao Nanfeng,

250
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:09,920
saying she was willing
to do private shoots

251
00:10:09,920 --> 00:10:10,780
for 1,200 a day.

252
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:16,960
She's new.

253
00:10:18,040 --> 00:10:19,000
Too many rough edges.

254
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:19,860
Hard to handle.

255
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:22,930
Is there a girl you can't handle, Zhao?

256
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:24,600
Need my help?

257
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:28,640
Yawen is the prettiest girl under my wing.

258
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:33,040
Shoot well.

259
00:10:33,240 --> 00:10:34,240
It's up to you now.

260
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:35,170
Alright,

261
00:10:35,520 --> 00:10:36,920
we won't bother you then.

262
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:37,570
Let's go.

263
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:45,280
Don't be nervous.

264
00:10:45,280 --> 00:10:46,600
We're all friends here.

265
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:48,120
I'm a great photographer.

266
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:50,440
I'll definitely take
beautiful pictures of you.

267
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:51,700
Here, have some water.

268
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:54,420
Take a break first.

269
00:10:54,640 --> 00:10:56,040
I'll set up the equipment,

270
00:10:56,040 --> 00:10:58,500
and then we'll start
our artistic creation.

271
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:16,650
After drinking that water,

272
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:19,320
Zhou Yawen quickly lost consciousness

273
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:22,440
and was raped by that photographer.

274
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:30,130
Who was that photographer?

275
00:11:31,680 --> 00:11:33,210
Don't think about revenge.

276
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:35,050
Revenge won't solve anything.

277
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:36,600
That photographer

278
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:38,060
was hired by Zhao Nanfeng.

279
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:39,500
Was the whole thing

280
00:11:39,800 --> 00:11:41,200
planned by Zhao Nanfeng?

281
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:43,920
It was all orchestrated by Zhao Nanfeng.

282
00:11:43,920 --> 00:11:46,080
She used this trick to gain our trust.

283
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:49,650
We were completely manipulated
by her back then.

284
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:50,400
Come here.

285
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:51,560
Come here.

286
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:54,920
Come and look at yourself.

287
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:55,280
Come on.

288
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:55,840
Look.

289
00:11:58,040 --> 00:11:59,970
The cameras were rolling that day.

290
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,520
They caught everything.

291
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:03,080
You threw yourself

292
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:04,320
into his arms.

293
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:06,680
Feeling ashamed now?

294
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:10,440
No.

295
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:12,200
No.

296
00:12:13,920 --> 00:12:15,080
I was drugged.

297
00:12:15,920 --> 00:12:16,980
Where's the proof?

298
00:12:17,520 --> 00:12:18,480
You have no proof at all.

299
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:19,740
Who would believe you?

300
00:12:19,880 --> 00:12:20,240
Fine.

301
00:12:20,400 --> 00:12:21,280
Go sue him now.

302
00:12:23,040 --> 00:12:24,120
Can you win?

303
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:30,180
Take my advice.

304
00:12:31,680 --> 00:12:32,810
What's done is done.

305
00:12:33,920 --> 00:12:35,450
You might as well accept it.

306
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:39,560
I've already paid

307
00:12:40,640 --> 00:12:41,900
to get your video back.

308
00:12:48,920 --> 00:12:49,920
Give it back to me.

309
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:50,920
Please.

310
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:56,280
I paid a heavy price

311
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:58,800
for your little mess.

312
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,840
You think I'll just give it to you

313
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:02,900
because you asked?

314
00:13:04,400 --> 00:13:05,600
Then what do you want?

315
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:09,640
I was planning to let you go at first.

316
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:11,200
But you're unlucky

317
00:13:11,200 --> 00:13:12,130
to run into this.

318
00:13:14,280 --> 00:13:15,520
Maybe it's just fate.

319
00:13:21,680 --> 00:13:22,160
Yawen.

320
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:28,240
You're not a virgin anymore anyway.

321
00:13:29,400 --> 00:13:30,730
Stop being so dramatic.

322
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:32,640
Just work hard for me.

323
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:45,860
Work for a month first.

324
00:13:46,240 --> 00:13:47,480
If you really don't want to,

325
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:48,540
pay back the money.

326
00:13:48,680 --> 00:13:49,680
And we'll be even.

327
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:21,640
Then why didn't you help her?

328
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:25,400
Why didn't you call the police for her?

329
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:27,660
Zhou Yawen didn't say anything herself.

330
00:14:28,120 --> 00:14:30,250
I was also threatened by Zhao Nanfeng.

331
00:14:30,400 --> 00:14:31,760
What could I do?

332
00:14:36,720 --> 00:14:37,800
After that,

333
00:14:38,680 --> 00:14:40,010
she completely gave in.

334
00:14:41,640 --> 00:14:42,720
She felt ruined,

335
00:14:43,400 --> 00:14:45,930
so she just went all the way
down the dark path.

336
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:50,640
Then

337
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:54,060
why didn't she go home?

338
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:56,840
Go home?

339
00:14:58,680 --> 00:14:59,880
After all that,

340
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:03,080
without making a single penny,

341
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:04,540
who would quit and go home?

342
00:15:06,160 --> 00:15:07,360
After that incident,

343
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:08,770
she figured things out.

344
00:15:09,640 --> 00:15:10,360
Before long,

345
00:15:10,360 --> 00:15:12,560
she became the top earner in our circle.

346
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:14,160
Relying on her assets,

347
00:15:14,800 --> 00:15:17,600
she'd pick fights
with Zhao Nanfeng for no reason.

348
00:15:20,320 --> 00:15:21,450
That's all I can say.

349
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:24,160
Do you have anything else to ask?

350
00:15:24,800 --> 00:15:25,240
No.

351
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:27,880
You still have important details left out.

352
00:15:29,880 --> 00:15:31,210
Does Zhou Yawen's death

353
00:15:31,400 --> 00:15:33,530
have anything to do with Zhao Nanfeng?

354
00:15:35,080 --> 00:15:36,010
How would I know?

355
00:15:36,040 --> 00:15:36,800
Don't ask me.

356
00:15:36,800 --> 00:15:37,920
In June 2014,

357
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:40,520
after Zhao Nanfeng returned to Beitan,

358
00:15:40,680 --> 00:15:41,810
did you look for her?

359
00:15:42,240 --> 00:15:42,640
No.

360
00:15:43,480 --> 00:15:44,280
You're lying.

361
00:15:44,440 --> 00:15:45,240
After she came back,

362
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:47,240
she received a transfer of 20,000 yuan,

363
00:15:47,240 --> 00:15:48,500
and the sender was you.

364
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:51,120
Why did Zhao Nanfeng look for you?

365
00:15:51,120 --> 00:15:52,050
Was it for money?

366
00:15:52,920 --> 00:15:54,160
Both you and Zhou Yawen

367
00:15:54,160 --> 00:15:55,080
sent her money.

368
00:15:55,640 --> 00:15:56,400
Did she use

369
00:15:56,400 --> 00:15:58,930
the photos and videos
she had to threaten you?

370
00:16:02,480 --> 00:16:05,840
You didn't even tell me
about something as big as your wedding.

371
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:07,700
So I could give you a wedding gift.

372
00:16:09,960 --> 00:16:11,320
I couldn't possibly.

373
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:17,400
You...

374
00:16:17,400 --> 00:16:18,120
I...

375
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:18,800
Yawen,

376
00:16:19,960 --> 00:16:22,440
the three of us have known
each other for so many years.

377
00:16:22,440 --> 00:16:23,600
We've been through

378
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:25,480
a lot together.

379
00:16:27,840 --> 00:16:29,200
Why so distant?

380
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:34,980
What are you afraid of?

381
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:37,640
I just wanted

382
00:16:38,400 --> 00:16:39,240
to drop by.

383
00:16:40,440 --> 00:16:41,760
Just to keep in touch.

384
00:16:44,120 --> 00:16:44,840
I'm not

385
00:16:46,240 --> 00:16:47,880
as lucky as Zhou Yawen,

386
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:49,320
who found a rich man.

387
00:16:51,200 --> 00:16:51,680
I live

388
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:53,680
a hard life.

389
00:16:54,840 --> 00:16:55,720
I only have

390
00:16:56,200 --> 00:16:57,480
20,000 yuan on me right now.

391
00:16:57,480 --> 00:16:58,480
I'll give it all to you,

392
00:16:58,480 --> 00:16:59,560
okay?

393
00:17:01,360 --> 00:17:03,400
Do you take me for a beggar?

394
00:17:05,480 --> 00:17:06,079
I only have

395
00:17:06,839 --> 00:17:08,839
this much on me right now.

396
00:17:12,400 --> 00:17:13,460
Go find Zhou Yawen.

397
00:17:13,480 --> 00:17:14,280
She has money.

398
00:17:14,480 --> 00:17:15,000
Go on.

399
00:17:16,240 --> 00:17:17,800
Zhou Yawen knows a businessman

400
00:17:17,800 --> 00:17:18,859
named Gu Zhicheng.

401
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:20,920
He's worth at least tens of millions.

402
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:22,180
And he treats her well.

403
00:17:22,280 --> 00:17:24,140
Zhou Yawen definitely has money.

404
00:17:26,520 --> 00:17:28,000
Is Zhou Yawen's child

405
00:17:28,960 --> 00:17:29,820
over a year old?

406
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:32,160
Yes.

407
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:33,200
Yes.

408
00:17:34,440 --> 00:17:36,240
So Zhao Nanfeng went to my sister

409
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:39,580
because of you.

410
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:47,000
So you guys got my sister

411
00:17:49,320 --> 00:17:50,840
killed.

412
00:17:51,080 --> 00:17:51,800
Zhou Yajun,

413
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:55,250
your sister's death isn't confirmed yet.

414
00:17:55,400 --> 00:17:56,530
Let Liu Qian finish.

415
00:18:02,720 --> 00:18:05,200
I thought she would just take the money.

416
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:08,480
How was I supposed to know
Zhao Nanfeng would kill her?

417
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:16,770
It's Zhao Nanfeng calling.

418
00:18:18,680 --> 00:18:19,280
Answer it.

419
00:18:25,400 --> 00:18:27,600
Zhou Yajun withdrew the appeal, right?

420
00:18:27,920 --> 00:18:28,450
Liu Qian,

421
00:18:29,160 --> 00:18:30,320
you did a good job.

422
00:18:32,480 --> 00:18:34,010
I'm in the clear now, right?

423
00:18:34,520 --> 00:18:35,880
Can you destroy

424
00:18:36,160 --> 00:18:37,600
all those photos and videos of me?

425
00:18:37,600 --> 00:18:38,840
Take it easy.

426
00:18:39,600 --> 00:18:42,000
I still need your help with something.

427
00:18:42,320 --> 00:18:43,720
You promised me.

428
00:18:43,840 --> 00:18:45,280
As long as Zhou Yajun withdrew the appeal,

429
00:18:45,280 --> 00:18:46,160
you'd let me go.

430
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:49,140
Are you in any position
to negotiate with me?

431
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:51,730
Whether you listen to me

432
00:18:52,480 --> 00:18:53,280
is up to you.

433
00:18:54,080 --> 00:18:55,600
What else do you want me to do?

434
00:18:55,600 --> 00:18:58,060
Have Zhou Yajun write
a letter of complaint.

435
00:18:59,480 --> 00:19:00,160
Report

436
00:19:00,960 --> 00:19:03,560
prosecutors

437
00:19:03,920 --> 00:19:04,640
Fang Wei

438
00:19:04,640 --> 00:19:05,680
and Xu Yishan

439
00:19:06,520 --> 00:19:09,000
of the First Division
for secretly inciting families

440
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:11,760
and illegally investigating
innocent people.

441
00:19:15,480 --> 00:19:16,540
I'm not writing it.

442
00:19:19,120 --> 00:19:20,560
You're together.

443
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:23,400
You should've said so.

444
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:24,320
I could've

445
00:19:25,320 --> 00:19:27,200
just notified you directly.

446
00:19:28,680 --> 00:19:29,840
You're a murderer.

447
00:19:30,720 --> 00:19:31,780
You deserve to die.

448
00:19:32,280 --> 00:19:32,940
Zhou Yajun,

449
00:19:33,720 --> 00:19:34,920
you can be shameless,

450
00:19:35,600 --> 00:19:37,400
but your sister is already dead.

451
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:40,720
You don't want people gossiping

452
00:19:40,840 --> 00:19:41,680
about her after her death,

453
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:43,440
do you?

454
00:19:47,920 --> 00:19:48,720
Zhao Nanfeng,

455
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:49,640
you can't get away.
